{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman Rumble is a single player, over-the-shoulder beat 'em up where you get to beat the coins out of your opponents and climb the ranks in the gladiator arena. To become a legendary roman wrestler, home-run your opponents with nothing but your fists as you\u2019re outnumbered, but never out armed. Flex at your fans and hear them revel in your glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glorious Display</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your glory meter, by damaging and taunting your enemies, to receive gifts from the crowd. These gifts will help you become an even greater warrior, giving you unique powers in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/70bdfb79ef89661c1f2b1a6a6e44325e.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/70bdfb79ef89661c1f2b1a6a6e44325e.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/70bdfb79ef89661c1f2b1a6a6e44325e.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Underdog to Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must defeat 5 waves of enemies in a gladiator arena with inspiration from wrestling. By completing a run of the gauntlet (the 5 waves), the player will become the champion of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/478cb6817461a24edae6c6873e0caace.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/478cb6817461a24edae6c6873e0caace.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/478cb6817461a24edae6c6873e0caace.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Theatrical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finesse the hit combos to launch enemies into the air! And make the crowd go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/4f04289f5401e4b11c515cbf4bea2d98.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/4f04289f5401e4b11c515cbf4bea2d98.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/4f04289f5401e4b11c515cbf4bea2d98.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/fab28c7156a84c77def15f072e48b2e5.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/fab28c7156a84c77def15f072e48b2e5.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/fab28c7156a84c77def15f072e48b2e5.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team name is E-Motion Studios. Our goal is to create a third-person action game that blends the spectacle of wrestling with the brutal drama of Roman gladiator combat.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>The Team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designers - Sebastian Poutanen, Tom Fasham, Lachlan Sharman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programmers - Hailey Graham, Peter Erbeni, Jack May</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists - Parker Laansma, Yuxuan Zhou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer - Belita Welsh</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Grand Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899640/2b443863932dfdecf5e1f2d3109e8aba5c1634de.jpg"},{"name":"Crowd Weezer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899640/545880c1993df0bc0c56a6332c9f4e8fd50445d6.jpg"},{"name":"Rage Baiter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899640/2f78c38f0dad12d91b8903eb41028b111805f452.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899640/6865e0ae0cf92ccfdbf473dc6ba449f2c16a1c1f.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899640?t=1761184767","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899640?t=1761184767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/30ddec182d772922adf4577647ec258e49fc1551/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761184767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/30ddec182d772922adf4577647ec258e49fc1551/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761184767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence depicted for arena combat"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman Rumble is a single player, over-the-shoulder beat 'em up where you get to beat the coins out of your opponents and climb the ranks in the gladiator arena. To become a legendary roman wrestler, home-run your opponents with nothing but your fists as you\u2019re outnumbered, but never out armed. Flex at your fans and hear them revel in your glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glorious Display</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your glory meter, by damaging and taunting your enemies, to receive gifts from the crowd. These gifts will help you become an even greater warrior, giving you unique powers in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.poster.avif?t=1761184767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.webm?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899640/extras/ec9a384782ef8237c175e673c0f793a5.mp4?t=1761184767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m